msgid "# Shared host Engram over HIXL"
msgstr "# 基于 HIXL 的共享主机 Engram"

msgid ""
"This opt-in DeepSeek V4.1 backend keeps one immutable Engram table in an "
"external owner process. Independent prefill and decode instances retrieve "
"selected quantized rows over HIXL instead of loading a complete host table "
"per instance. It supports INT8 codes with E8M0 or FP32 scales, and FP8 E4M3 "
"codes with E8M0 scales."
msgstr ""
"这种可选的 DeepSeek V4.1 后端在外部 owner 进程中保留一份不可变的 Engram 表。独立的 prefill 和 decode "
"实例通过 HIXL 检索选定的量化行，而不是为每个实例加载完整的主机表。它支持带 E8M0 或 FP32 缩放因子的 INT8 编码，以及带 E8M0 "
"缩放因子的 FP8 E4M3 编码。"

msgid "## Data path"
msgstr "## 数据路径"

msgid ""
"This is explicit selected-row transfer. The NPU does not dereference a "
"remote DRAM pointer. The owner does not stage the entire table into HBM. "
"TP/DP collectives, selected-row HBM storage and graph-input copies remain. "
"Engram lookup runs before decode graph replay; the decoder graph mode does "
"not need to be disabled. KVPool storage and Mooncake P/D KV transfer retain "
"their existing connectors."
msgstr ""
"这是显式的选定行传输。NPU 不会解引用远程 DRAM 指针。owner 不会将整个表暂存到 HBM。TP/DP 集合通信、选定行 HBM "
"存储和图输入拷贝保持不变。Engram 查找在 decode 图重放之前运行；无需禁用解码器图模式。KVPool 存储和 Mooncake P/D KV"
" 传输保留其现有的连接器。"

msgid ""
"On A2 the tested configuration uses device RoCE. On A5 configure HIXL device"
" UB/URMA endpoints; the transport is selected by HIXL's communication "
"resources, not by the host-side engine address. A5 small-table FP8 lookup "
"has been exercised across two nodes; full-model and multi-reader "
"qualification remain separate."
msgstr ""
"在 A2 上，经过测试的配置使用设备 RoCE。在 A5 上，配置 HIXL 设备 UB/URMA 端点；传输方式由 HIXL "
"的通信资源选择，而不是由主机侧引擎地址选择。A5 小表 FP8 查找已在两个节点间进行过验证；全模型和多读取器认证仍单独进行。"

msgid ""
"On A5, provide a device UB endpoint JSON with owner `--local-comm-res` and "
"consumer `local_comm_res`. For multiple devices, the path may contain "
"`{physical}`, replaced with the process physical device ID. Each process "
"needs resources generated for its own device. Set owner `--fabric ub` to "
"bypass the A2 RoCE-specific alternate-device workaround; the endpoint "
"resources must still specify device UB."
msgstr ""
"在 A5 上，为 owner 的 `--local-comm-res` 和消费者的 `local_comm_res` 提供设备 UB 端点 "
"JSON。对于多设备，路径中可包含 `{physical}`，会被替换为进程的物理设备 ID。每个进程需要为其自身设备生成的资源。设置 owner 的 "
"`--fabric ub` 以绕过 A2 上特定于 RoCE 的备用设备变通方案；端点资源仍必须指定设备 UB。"

msgid ""
"The two-layer hash copy happens before either layer enqueues its TP "
"exchange. This removes the second ID copy's dependency on the first layer's "
"queued exchange. Each HIXL read still waits for the previous use of its "
"shared local buffer before reuse."
msgstr ""
"两层哈希拷贝在任一层将其 TP 交换入队之前发生。这消除了第二个 ID 拷贝对第一层已入队交换的依赖。每次 HIXL "
"读取在复用其共享本地缓冲区之前，仍会等待该缓冲区上一次使用完成。"

msgid ""
"When the owner advertises batch lookup and both layers' selected rows fit "
"within `capacity`, one request packs both layers and one HIXL READ fetches "
"them. Each layer is then dequantized into its own local BF16 result before "
"the existing exchanges. This keeps the registered receive buffer unchanged, "
"with bounded simultaneous per-layer results. Larger batches, older owners "
"and the direct single-rank graph-buffer path retain per-layer lookup. No new"
" collective or decoder graph requirement is introduced."
msgstr ""
"当 owner 声明支持批量查找，且两层的选定行都能容纳在 `capacity` 之内时，一个请求会打包两层，并通过一次 HIXL READ "
"获取它们。随后在现有交换之前，每一层会被反量化为其各自的本地 BF16 "
"结果。这保持了已注册接收缓冲区不变，同时每层结果的同时存在量是有界的。更大的批次、较旧的 owner 以及直接的单 rank "
"图缓冲区路径仍保留逐层查找。不引入新的集合通信或解码器图要求。"

msgid "## Build and start"
msgstr "## 构建与启动"

msgid ""
"The native adapter uses the installed CANN HIXL headers and library rather "
"than the HIXL Python extension. The CMake build includes `libengram_hixl.so`"
" when the HIXL library is present. For a standalone build against an "
"installed SDK:"
msgstr ""
"原生适配器使用已安装的 CANN HIXL 头文件和库，而不是 HIXL Python 扩展。当 HIXL 库存在时，CMake 构建会包含 "
"`libengram_hixl.so`。针对已安装的 SDK 进行独立构建："

msgid "Start the owner with reachable, distinct control and HIXL endpoints:"
msgstr "使用可访问且互不相同的控制端点和 HIXL 端点启动 owner："

msgid ""
"Wait for `POOL_READY` from this owner process. Enable consumers with "
"`cpu_offload=true` and `dp_shared_memory=true` in `--engram-config`, and "
"merge the following into their existing `--additional-config`:"
msgstr ""
"等待此 owner 进程输出 `POOL_READY`。在 `--engram-config` 中设置 `cpu_offload=true` 和 "
"`dp_shared_memory=true` 以启用消费者，并将以下内容合并到其现有的 `--additional-config` 中："

msgid ""
"For A5, use `--backend a5` for the owner and `\"backend\": \"a5\"` for "
"consumers. Select the owner transport explicitly with `--fabric ub` or "
"`--fabric roce` as appropriate."
msgstr ""
"对于 A5，owner 使用 `--backend a5`，消费者使用 `\"backend\": \"a5\"`。根据情况使用 `--fabric "
"ub` 或 `--fabric roce` 显式选择 owner 的传输方式。"

msgid ""
"Owner `--listen-port` and `--local-comm-res` are mutually exclusive. "
"Consumers may set `listen_port` or `local_comm_res` in `shared_engram`; "
"these options are mutually exclusive and omitted by default. Rebuild the "
"native adapter when updating this code."
msgstr ""
"owner 的 `--listen-port` 和 `--local-comm-res` 互斥。消费者可在 `shared_engram` 中设置 "
"`listen_port` 或 `local_comm_res`；这些选项互斥，且默认省略。更新此代码时需重新构建原生适配器。"

msgid ""
"`capacity` is a minimum number of selected rows in one lookup, not a token "
"count. The consumer chooses the larger of 65536, configured capacity, and "
"the maximum batch or graph size multiplied by the largest per-TP single-"
"layer head count, then sends that capacity to the owner on attach. The "
"supported limit is 262144 rows; configurations requiring more fail at "
"startup. Two-layer batches may fall back to per-layer lookup. A single-layer"
" lookup exceeding the negotiated capacity fails locally without retiring the"
" reader and is not split automatically. The consumer allocates a bounded "
"packed-row HBM buffer; the owner allocates a pinned stage of the same "
"capacity per connected reader. Other Engram result/exchange buffers remain "
"additional allocations."
msgstr ""
"`capacity` 是一次查找中选定行的最小数量，而不是 token 数量。消费者会在 65536、配置的 "
"capacity，以及最大批次或图大小乘以每 TP 单层最大 head 数三者中取较大值，并在附加时将该项 capacity 发送给 "
"owner。支持的限额为 262144 行；需要更多行的配置会在启动时失败。两层批次可能回退到逐层查找。超过协商 capacity "
"的单层查找会在本地失败，且不会使读取器退役，也不会自动拆分。消费者分配一个有界的打包行 HBM 缓冲区；owner 为每个已连接的读取器分配一个相同 "
"capacity 的固定暂存区。其他 Engram 结果/交换缓冲区仍为额外分配。"

msgid ""
"The consumer requires the accompanying core loader change that invokes the "
"model's unused-checkpoint-weight filter before materializing a tensor. "
"Metadata-only parameters alone do not prevent a loader from temporarily "
"loading the full table. The multimodal wrapper forwards this filter too."
msgstr ""
"消费者需要配套的核心加载器改动，该改动会在实体化张量之前调用模型的未使用检查点权重过滤器。仅靠仅含元数据的参数并不能阻止加载器临时加载完整表。多模态封装层也会转发此过滤器。"

msgid "## Placement and lifecycle"
msgstr "## 部署与生命周期"

msgid ""
"The owner runs as a separate process and needs an NPU for HIXL even though "
"its persistent table is in DRAM. It may be co-located with a model instance;"
" reserve distinct HIXL device listen ports to avoid a conflict with model "
"communication. In the A2 device RoCE configuration, a reader using the "
"owner's device connects through another visible owner device. This "
"implementation does not use a direct local-memory lookup. Verify the "
"available devices and resource accounting for the deployment."
msgstr ""
"owner 作为独立进程运行，尽管其持久表位于 DRAM 中，但仍需要一块 NPU 用于 HIXL。它可以与模型实例共置；请预留不同的 HIXL "
"设备监听端口，以避免与模型通信冲突。在 A2 设备 RoCE 配置中，使用 owner 设备的读取器会通过另一个可见的 owner "
"设备进行连接。此实现不使用直接的本地内存查找。请验证部署可用的设备及资源核算。"

msgid ""
"Readers compare checkpoint metadata and sampled boundary weights before attaching. Each owner has a generation; mismatched generations and invalid lookup shapes fail explicitly. Sampling is a compatibility check, not a full checkpoint checksum or a model-quality evaluation.\n"
"Owner and readers must use matching protocol versions: attachment includes the physical device ID as well as row dtype and index metadata, so mixed old and new versions reject attachment."
msgstr ""
"读取器在附加之前会比较检查点元数据和采样的边界权重。每个 owner 都有一个 generation；generation 不匹配和无效的查找形状会显式失败。采样是一种兼容性检查，而不是完整的检查点校验和或模型质量评估。\n"
"owner 和读取器必须使用匹配的协议版本：附加过程包含物理设备 ID 以及行 dtype 和索引元数据，因此新旧版本混用会拒绝附加。"

msgid ""
"On normal shutdown, the reader synchronizes NPU use, disconnects/deregisters"
" its local transport, and asks the owner to retire its leased stage. Set a "
"positive `--shutdown-timeout` on every consumer so its worker processes have"
" time to run this cleanup; the default immediate shutdown can force-kill "
"workers and leave retained leases. An unexpected socket EOF does not prove "
"outstanding RDMA has retired, so the owner retains that stage "
"conservatively. Automatic reclamation after consumer crashes and transparent"
" owner failover are not implemented. Owner shutdown drains normal leases; a "
"retained failed lease can keep it draining."
msgstr ""
"正常关闭时，reader 会同步 NPU 使用情况，断开/注销其本地传输，并请求 owner 回收其租用的 stage。请在每个 consumer "
"上设置一个正的 `--shutdown-timeout`，以便其 worker 进程有时间执行此清理；默认的立即关闭可能会强制杀死 worker "
"并留下保留的租约。意外的 socket EOF 并不能证明未完成的 RDMA 已回收，因此 owner 会保守地保留该 stage。consumer "
"崩溃后的自动回收以及透明的 owner 故障转移尚未实现。owner 关闭时会排空正常租约；一个保留的失败租约可能会使其持续处于排空状态。"

msgid ""
"Set `VLLM_WORKER_SHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` high enough for readers to close;"
" the shared backend defaults it to 120 seconds if unset."
msgstr ""
"将 `VLLM_WORKER_SHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` 设置得足够大，以便 reader "
"能够关闭；如果未设置，共享后端会将其默认为 120 秒。"

msgid "## Validation and performance claims"
msgstr "## 验证与性能声明"

msgid ""
"Focused tests cover protocol bounds, checkpoint compatibility, loading under"
" a non-CPU default device, packed-row handling, batched ID ordering and both"
" supported scale representations. Full-size checkpoint row probes cover both"
" Engram layers, nonzero head offsets and invalid-ID masking. End-to-end "
"validation must additionally preserve the intended P/D topology, decoder "
"graph configuration, KVPool capacity and production request distribution."
msgstr ""
"专项测试覆盖协议边界、checkpoint 兼容性、在非 CPU 默认设备下加载、packed-row 处理、批量 ID 排序以及两种受支持的 "
"scale 表示。全尺寸 checkpoint 行探测覆盖两个 Engram 层、非零 head 偏移和无效 ID 掩码。端到端验证还必须保持预期的 "
"P/D 拓扑、decoder 图配置、KVPool 容量和生产请求分布。"

msgid ""
"Report unique table bytes, owner/staging memory, device buffers and task "
"reservations separately. DP-shared native host mappings must not be "
"multiplied by the worker count. Process PSS may omit driver-managed Host "
"allocations. Restoring a larger KVPool can increase total configured DRAM "
"even while eliminating duplicated Engram tables. Small lookup "
"microbenchmarks alone do not establish serving throughput or SLO "
"equivalence."
msgstr ""
"请分别报告唯一表字节数、owner/staging 内存、设备缓冲区和任务预留。DP 共享的原生 host 映射不得乘以 worker 数量。进程 "
"PSS 可能会遗漏驱动管理的 Host 分配。恢复更大的 KVPool 即使在消除重复的 Engram 表的同时，也可能增加配置的总 "
"DRAM。仅靠小型查找微基准测试无法确立服务吞吐量或 SLO 等效性。"
